:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public transport"},{"text":"Walking"},{"text":"Cycling"},{"text":"Traffic"},{"text":"Parking"},{"text":"EV charging"},{"text":"Transit hubs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Urban Digital Twin"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a conceptual digital twin of a neighbourhood."},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"3D buildings"},{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Environmental data"},{"text":"Then demonstrate how the platform could support planning decisions."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Smart Water Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a technology-enabled water strategy."},{"type":"p","text":"Integrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Water Network","IoT Sensors","Consumption Data","Leak Detection","Analytics","Predictive Maintenance","Water Efficiency"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — AI-Based Urban Growth Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Use historical spatial data to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban expansion"},{"text":"Land-use change"},{"text":"Infrastructure growth"},{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Development pressure"},{"text":"Then develop alternative growth scenarios."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["Prioritize internships combining planning","technology","data."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Highest-value internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Smart city consultancy"},{"text":"Urban planning consultancy"},{"text":"GIS consultancy"},{"text":"Urban analytics company"},{"text":"Government smart-city organization"},{"text":"Municipal corporation"},{"text":"Infrastructure consultancy"},{"text":"Intelligent transportation company"},{"text":"Mobility-tech company"},{"text":"Sustainability consultancy"},{"text":"Digital twin company"},{"text":"Geospatial technology company"},{"text":"Urban research institute"},{"text":"PropTech / urban-tech company"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"}